From: Abue Ammar <iabueammar@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:23:13 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Refactor issue templates to improve readability of
 introductory messages

---
 .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml      | 5 +----
 .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml | 4 +---
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml b/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml
index 3cc91b38..8e02e1c2 100644
--- a/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml
+++ b/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml
@@ -6,10 +6,7 @@ body:
   - type: markdown
     attributes:
       value: |
-        **Check this first.** Some behaviour is a choice, not a bug, and those reports are closed as
-        not planned. Read
-        [What Tinycast Won't Do](https://github.com/abue-ammar/tinycast/blob/main/docs/not-planned.md)
-        before you open this.
+        **Check this first.** Some behaviour is a choice, not a bug, and those reports are closed as not planned. Read [What Tinycast Won't Do](https://github.com/abue-ammar/tinycast/blob/main/docs/not-planned.md) before you open this.
   - type: checkboxes
     id: existing-search
     attributes:
diff --git a/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml b/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml
index 5b71a633..0976ca13 100644
--- a/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml
+++ b/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml
@@ -6,9 +6,7 @@ body:
   - type: markdown
     attributes:
       value: |
-        **Check this first.** Many ideas have already been declined on purpose. Read
-        [What Tinycast Won't Do](https://github.com/abue-ammar/tinycast/blob/main/docs/not-planned.md)
-        before you open this.
+        **Check this first.** Many ideas have already been declined on purpose. Read [What Tinycast Won't Do](https://github.com/abue-ammar/tinycast/blob/main/docs/not-planned.md) before you open this.
   - type: textarea
     id: what
     attributes:
